{10}{My name is Frank Castle, and I'm the leader of the Tech Rebels.}{My name is Frank Castle, and I'm the leader of the Tech Rebels.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{The Tech Rebels?  What's that?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{12}{What are you doing out here in tents?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
