{20}{My companions and I decided to leave Latveria due to Doom's insane quest to rid all of Arcanum of magic.  We're technologist - so we have no love of magic - but desiring the complete annihilation of it is bordering on the insane.}{My companions and I decided to leave Latveria due to Doom's insane quest to rid all of Arcanum of magic.  We're technologist - so we have no love of magic - but desiring the complete annihilation of it is bordering on the insane.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{The complete annihilation of magic?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{22}{Actually, I think he is right on track.  Arcanum could use a good 'magic cleansing'.}{}{5}{}{50}{}
{29}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{30}{We are a small group of technologists that have setup camp down here away from town.  We're trying to decide what to do since Doom is amassing an army which he plans to use to hunt down and kill every magic user in Arcanum.}{We are a small group of technologists that have setup camp down here away from town.  We're trying to decide what to do since Doom is amassing an army which he plans to use to hunt down and kill every magic user in Arcanum.}{}{}{}{}
{31}{Why did you leave town?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{32}{What are you planning to do?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{39}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{40}{Yes.  Doom hope to destroy every magic user in Arcanum, and every book, scroll, and item pertaining to magic.}{Yes.  Doom hope to destroy every magic user in Arcanum, and every book, scroll, and item pertaining to magic.}{}{}{}{}
{41}{That IS insane!  How can he hope to accomplish such an undertaking?}{}{5}{}{70}{}
{42}{Interesting.  I should go talk to him and see if he needs any help!}{}{5}{}{50}{}
{49}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{50}{That's pathetic.  We're talking about destroying one half of what makes Arcanum thrive.  There may be an apparent dichotomy between technology and magic, but together they make up our world.  If you destroy one, the other will soon crumble.}{}{}{}{}{}
{51}{I don't agree with you.  I think Doom is correct.}{}{5}{}{80}{}
{52}{I understand.  What are you planning to do about Doom and his army?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{59}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{60}{Right now we are designing and gathering components for an airship.  We feel it will give us the best view of the land and we need a tactical advantage over Doom's superior forces.}{Right now we are designing and gathering components for an airship.  We feel it will give us the best view of the land and we need a tactical advantage over Doom's superior forces.}{}{}{}{}
{61}{Is there anything I can do to help?}{}{5}{}{90}{}
{62}{Yeah.  Good luck with that.  See ya around.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{69}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{70}{Not only is he amassing an army, he is also working on a device that can absorb magical energy.  We believe he wants to use this to ultimately absorb all of the magic in Arcanum, thus rendering Arcanum magically barren.}{Not only is he amassing an army, he is also working on a device that can absorb magical energy.  We believe he wants to use this to ultimately absorb all of the magic in Arcanum, thus rendering Arcanum magically barren.}{}{}{}{}
{71}{What can be done about this?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{72}{Sounds like too much trouble for me.  I think I'll go on about my business.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
