{200}{[a look of concern comes over the man's face]  Okay.  I'll level with you.  The Converter is a key component to the weapon Doom is constructing.  We believe we can construct it before him if we have that component.  It has to do with a Chain Reaction of particles that are smaller than the eye can see.}{[a look of concern comes over the man's face]  Okay.  I'll level with you.  The Converter is a key component to the weapon Doom is constructing.  We believe we can construct it before him if we have that component.  It has to do with a Chain Reaction of particles that are smaller than the eye can see.}{}{}{}{}
